  lines:
  - There is a list in the desk drawer just like captain Sharp said.
  - '"Lingas-249 Expedition Team: Captain Eleanora Sharp - [Channel 1, Frequency
    186], Doctor Edgar Moss - [Channel 4, Frequency 398], Doctor Dennis Banc..."'
  - The rest of the note is illegible. The paper is torn and stained.
  - '*Sigh* Of Course...'
  - All I have to do now is tune to frequency 398 and find it's location south west
    from the tower.
